Date:		Oct 2025
KernelVersion:	6.6
Contact:	Yanlong Zhu <zhuyanlong3@huawei.com>
Description:
		(RO) Displays the MAPT mode of Token ID.  Format: %s. Allowed values:

		================	===========================
		MAPT_MODE_TABLE		Token ID is table mode.
		MAPT_MODE_ENTRY		Token ID is entry mode.
		MAPT_MODE_END		MAPT is not used for this Token ID.
		================	===========================

